From: StanleyYP Wang <StanleyYP.Wang@mediatek.com>
Date: Fri, 31 Mar 2023 11:27:24 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] wifi: mt76: mt7996: pre-calibration and testmode support

Group and DPD pre-calibration: load precal data from flash/nvmem,
size it from per-chip/variant layout tables (eagle 444/233, kite),
apply group cal and per-channel TX DPD in normal mode, and support
the testmode pre-cal flows including kite. Adds 5GHz channels 68-96
to the common channel table with a DPD skip list covering them, and
fixes the MT7992 precal layout.

Squash of the following MediaTek commits:
- wifi: mt76: testmode: add testmode pre-calibration support
  (StanleyYP Wang, 2023-03-31)
- wifi: mt76: mt7996: load precal data from flash/nvmem
  (StanleyYP Wang, 2023-03-31)
- wifi: mt76: mt7996: add normal mode pre-calibration support
  (StanleyYP Wang, 2023-03-01)
- wifi: mt76: mt7996: add channel 68 & 96 (StanleyYP Wang, 2023-09-11)
- wifi: mt76: testmode: add kite testmode support
  (StanleyYP Wang, 2023-10-12)
- wifi: mt76: mt7996: add Eagle 2adie TBTC (BE14000) support
  (StanleyYP Wang, 2023-12-05)
- wifi: mt76: mt7996: fix MT7992 precal layout issue
  (StanleyYP Wang, 2025-12-30)
